data: {"id": "90ebcb1cd9d54120-thinking-parallel_evidence-279", "run_id": "90ebcb1cd9d54120", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已掌握该 Pod 的 YAML、describe、events 和 status。关键事实：**Pod 当前 phase=Running** 且 **containerStatuses.ready=True**，但 **reason=OOMKilled, exitCode=137, restarts=27**。这表明 Pod 虽处于 Running 状态，但容器经历了多达 27 次重启，且最近一次退出的直接原因是 OOMKilled。\n\n接下来，我将查看当前实例的日志以确认是否有 OOM 记录，并查询最近 30 分钟的 Metrics 验证内存使用情况。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788457600133, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

